      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "寄信人是──吉兆。\n她以诚挚的笔触写下一封“邀请函”──\n邀约我今天下午在咖啡厅碰面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c064b9b5e7d222d46d96dba45f8b5c969c02a7e0de1e355d675f0ab34961ffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
