    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9bfe915e274866531419b73",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是情人节夜晚的星空。\n说到冬季星座，就得从猎户座开始。\n由星星所组成的四角形中，有三颗整齐排列──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c2af1b90baae09c0638f65cc4825c4b88416640db7c9f2deacdc097a64859a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083107.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
